    {
      "id": "1958d29c-0464-4ead-8c53-1b79b634d5d0",
      "object": "block",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Cook toor dal until soft and mushy. In a separate pot, boil drumstick, onion, and tomatoes with turmeric until vegetables are tender. Add tamarind paste dissolved in warm water. Add sambar powder and salt. Simmer 15 minutes. Add cooked dal and stir. For tempering: heat oil, add mustard seeds, urad dal, dried red chilies, and curry leaves. Pour over sambar. Add jaggery at the very end, just a tiny piece. Garnish with cilantro."
            },
            "plain_text": "Cook toor dal until soft and mushy. In a separate pot, boil drumstick, onion, and tomatoes with turmeric until vegetables are tender. Add tamarind paste dissolved in warm water. Add sambar powder and salt. Simmer 15 minutes. Add cooked dal and stir. For tempering: heat oil, add mustard seeds, urad dal, dried red chilies, and curry leaves. Pour over sambar. Add jaggery at the very end, just a tiny piece. Garnish with cilantro."
          }
        ]
      },
