            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "First attempt: Used 3 tbsp tamarind like the original card said. Too sour. Second attempt: Cut to 2 tbsp per Lakshmi's correction. Better but needed more salt. Third attempt: 2 tbsp tamarind, added jaggery at the end like Appa used to. This is it. Priya tried it and said it tasted like real homemade sambar. She doesn't know why I've been making so much sambar lately."
